":"通用動力 (GD) 任命 Amy Johnson 為 GDIT 總裁，自 2026 年 11 月 3 日起生效"},{"title":"General Dynamics Corp (GD) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: R","src":"GuruFocus","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"通用動力（GD）（2026 年第三季）財報電話會議亮點：R"},{"title":"General Dynamics (NYSE:GD) Releases FY 2026 Earnings Guidance","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxONnNOZTdGalJyZXIzejBIWHg2cE9pSW5OMy1Pb0FuVzk0bE5QalZ2VW45ZEtpb25mbHItRlkxRGp6WHZ4Qm10djNKMjRYM05tOHFQT2NmRmJTTE5wVmhhMFhJLTV1dFlJZmJoMmVReFIyS3dKb3FVV0FkNmtnUnNJc0Jwa1FURUVXS1R4OXl3TWJ1THpfZWtKQ1FocEhqd1o3NFJJcHhaSzMtbGFQZlVGUFdMenp6aDA0SnRrajVCdw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"通用動力公司 (NYSE:GD) 發布 2026 財年獲利指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-30","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/40533/000004053326000006/gd-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"General Dynamics is a global aerospace and defense company that specializes in high-end design, engineering and manufacturing to deliver state-of-the-art solutions to our customers. We offer a broad portfolio of products and services in business aviation; ship construction and repair; land combat vehicles, weapon systems and munitions; and technology products and services. Our leadership positions in attractive business aviation and defense markets enable us to deliver superior and enduring capabilities to our customers and returns to our shareholders.","zh":"通用動力公司是一家全球航空航太和國防公司，專門從事高端設計、工程和製造，為客戶提供最先進的解決方案。我們在公務航空領域提供廣泛的產品和服務組合；船舶建造和修理；陸上作戰車輛、武器系統和彈藥；以及技術產品和服務。我們在極具吸引力的公務航空和國防市場中的領導地位使我們能夠為客戶提供卓越且持久的能力，並為股東帶來回報。"},{"en":"Our company consists of 10 business units, which are organized into four operating segments: Aerospace, Marine Systems, Combat Systems and Technologies. We refer to the latter three collectively as our defense segments. To ensure market focus, customer intimacy, agility and operating expertise, each business unit is responsible for the development and execution of its strategy and operating results. This structure allows for a lean corporate function, which sets the overall strategy and governance for the company and is responsible for allocating and deploying capital.","zh":"我們公司由 10 個業務部門組成，分為四個營運部門：航空航太、海洋系統、作戰系統和技術。我們將後三個統稱為我們的防禦部分。為了確保市場焦點、客戶親密度、敏捷性和營運專業知識，每個業務部門負責制定和執行其策略和營運成果。這種結構允許精簡的公司職能，該職能為公司製定整體策略和治理，並負責分配和部署資本。"},{"en":"Our business units seek to deliver superior operating results by building industry-leading franchises. To achieve this goal, we invest in advanced technologies, focus on execution, pursue a culture of continuous improvement, and strive to be the low-cost, high-quality provider in each of our markets. The result is long-term value creation measured by delivering on our commitments to our customers coupled with strong earnings and cash flow and an attractive return on capital.","zh":"我们的业务部门力求通过建立行业领先的特许经营权来提供卓越的经营成果。為了實現這一目標，我們投資先進技術，注重執行，追求持續改善的文化，並努力成為每個市場的低成本、高品質的供應商。其结果是通过兑现对客户的承诺以及强劲的收入和现金流以及有吸引力的资本回报来衡量长期价值创造。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"In 2025, 68% of our consolidated revenue was from the U.S. government, 15% was from U.S. commercial customers, 8% was from non-U.S. government customers and the remaining 9% was from non-U.S. commercial customers.","zh":"2025年，我們合併收入的68%來自美國政府，15%來自美國商業客戶，8%來自非美國政府客戶，其餘9%來自非美國商業客戶。"},{"en":"Our primary customer is the DoW. We also contract with other U.S. government customers, including the intelligence community and other departments and agencies. Our revenue from the U.S. government was as follows:","zh":"我們的主要客戶是 DoW。我们还与其他美国政府客户签订合同，包括情报界以及其他部门和机构。我們從美國政府獲得的收入如下："}],"competition":[{"en":"Several factors determine our ability to compete successfully in the defense and business aviation markets. While customers' evaluation criteria vary, the principal competitive elements include:","zh":""},{"en":"our ability to innovate and develop new products and technologies that improve mission performance and adapt to dynamic threats;","zh":""}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Marine Systems","val":16723000000,"zh":"船舶系統"},{"name":"Technologies","val":13471000000,"zh":"科技"},{"name":"Aerospace","val":13110000000,"zh":"航太"},{"name":"Combat Systems","val":9246000000,"zh":"戰鬥系統"}],"total":52550000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":33021000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":19529000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":52550000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":44562000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":43314000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":5400000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Europe","val":3540000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Other Africa Middle East","val":2015000000,"zh":"Other Africa Middle East"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":2001000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other North America","val":1248000000,"zh":"北美其他地區"},{"name":"South America","val":432000000,"zh":"南美洲"}],"total":52550000000}},"peers":["NOC","LMT","RTX","HON","LHX"]}}